// extern fn declaration for examples/common_rpi5/tlb_asm.S's
// tlb_invalidate_va stub (GitHub issue #67 Stage 2, ported from
// examples/common_rpi3/tlb_asm_extern.tkb), split into its own file
// matching examples/common_rpi5/timer_asm_extern.tkb's own reasoning (a
// duplicate `extern fn` declaration is a hard conflict if two files
// needing it both declared it locally).
